            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Bi Do",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nEclectic but good seafood menu\nJun 2020\nI was curious as to why this place was called Pumpkin if it primarily serves seafood. Now, I've eaten there and still have no idea. But, the food is good it a bit pricey. I did not eat any of the more eclectic options like frog, snail or turtle (which are not eclectic in Vietnam). I tried a beef dish which was good but wasn't as hot as I'd have imagined since I was the only person there. The beef didn't really come with anything...it was just there.\n\nI also found the staff a bit stand-offish. Not super friendly...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 24, 2020",
